  This example gives binary output instead of counting the occurrence.

  >>> data = np.array([[1, 2, 3, 0], [0, 0, 1, 2]], dtype=np.int32)
  >>> tf.math.bincount(data, axis=-1, binary_output=True)
  <tf.Tensor: shape=(2, 4), dtype=int32, numpy=
    array([[1, 1, 1, 1],
